WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.120
|||||\\\\\\\\\\\\\

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.120
Release-Group "Mania" presents
http://doramamania

00:00:25.560 --> 01:13:29.300
Mania

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:43.020
Alchemy

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:43.020
Shower

00:01:18.770 --> 00:01:21.190
People will gossip if you suddenly disappear

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.490
Death in front of witnesses

00:01:23.570 --> 00:01:25.780
will simplify everything

00:01:27.910 --> 00:01:29.660
I want to save face

00:01:30.660 --> 00:01:32.620
I hope you die with dignity

00:01:37.710 --> 00:01:39.880
- Master!
- Mister!

00:01:43.260 --> 00:01:44.340
What is he saying?

00:01:44.430 --> 00:01:46.340
- What's happened?
- Look!

00:01:47.050 --> 00:01:48.930
Mercenaries!

00:02:18.460 --> 00:02:20.420
Master

00:02:29.090 --> 00:02:32.310
I will use your body with dignity

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:52.140
Project coordinator and editor: Ria_Lee

00:02:52.140 --> 00:02:57.140
Assistant coordinators: Martini, gaarysn

00:02:57.140 --> 00:03:02.140
Typesetter translator: Ria_Lee

00:03:25.940 --> 00:03:26.820
Owner

00:03:30.070 --> 00:03:32.240
Damn it

00:03:38.830 --> 00:03:40.000
Everything is fine

00:03:40.960 --> 00:03:41.960
Don't come in

00:03:46.840 --> 00:03:47.760
It's a shame

00:03:47.840 --> 00:03:50.470
Today he got it even more

00:03:50.550 --> 00:03:52.800
- Two more left?
- Yes

00:03:54.180 --> 00:03:56.430
Tomorrow Cha Bum

00:03:56.520 --> 00:03:58.520
I don't want to see Uk lose to him

00:03:59.180 --> 00:04:00.560
Maybe I should fight?

00:04:01.270 --> 00:04:03.230
I'll let Uku win and be done with it

00:04:03.310 --> 00:04:04.770
Uk would be happy about this

00:04:05.270 --> 00:04:07.360
The dispute is with the Crown Prince

00:04:07.440 --> 00:04:09.030
We need to outwit him

00:04:12.200 --> 00:04:14.120
Uk loses, but gains experience

00:04:16.200 --> 00:04:17.200
Owner

00:04:17.290 --> 00:04:19.960
Go to your room, I'll get towels

00:04:28.090 --> 00:04:30.880
I don't know who is the last one to fight him,

00:04:32.890 --> 00:04:34.850
but defeating Uka will not be so easy

00:04:49.320 --> 00:04:50.320
Chan Wook!

00:04:54.530 --> 00:04:55.780
Where is the owner?

00:04:56.370 --> 00:04:57.870
Oh, are you looking for him?

00:04:58.660 --> 00:04:59.660
Yes

00:05:00.450 --> 00:05:02.210
You're probably Moo Deok

00:05:03.420 --> 00:05:05.580
- Yes
- I see

00:05:05.670 --> 00:05:08.630
The one who is always next to Chan Wook

00:05:09.210 --> 00:05:12.420
That heron that the maid Kim spoke about

00:05:12.930 --> 00:05:15.760
I came to see him before leaving

00:05:15.840 --> 00:05:17.260
Come in. Ah...

00:05:17.350 --> 00:05:20.310
I brought snacks. Want?

00:05:21.140 --> 00:05:22.140
No thanks

00:05:30.650 --> 00:05:33.780
She is graceful and gentle, as the maid Kim said

00:06:34.010 --> 00:06:36.300
Why are you standing here wet?

00:06:38.300 --> 00:06:39.680
Hey look

00:06:57.450 --> 00:06:59.070
That guy did that, didn't he?

00:06:59.660 --> 00:07:01.830
I'll have to try it with a sword.

00:07:02.740 --> 00:07:05.620
I thought you were upset about falling into the water

00:07:06.500 --> 00:07:08.420
Did you rate your fight?

00:07:08.920 --> 00:07:11.750
That's what happened the first couple of times

00:07:11.840 --> 00:07:13.840
I'm just mad that I lost eight times

00:07:15.920 --> 00:07:19.380
You are used to walking around in something clean and ironed,

00:07:19.470 --> 00:07:22.350
and now you’re standing in wet and dirty, which means

00:07:23.470 --> 00:07:24.850
are you serious

00:07:28.100 --> 00:07:29.650
It's really dirty

00:07:34.820 --> 00:07:36.820
You were in a hurry today

00:07:36.900 --> 00:07:40.240
There was no need to attack when he was defending himself

00:07:40.320 --> 00:07:43.280
It was worth waiting for him to lower his defenses

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:45.490
Yes

00:07:45.580 --> 00:07:48.330
If you took a step back after the blows,

00:07:48.410 --> 00:07:51.790
he would relax and loosen

00:07:51.880 --> 00:07:53.340
protection

00:07:54.090 --> 00:07:56.130
Combat is a game of tug of war

00:07:56.760 --> 00:07:59.510
The enemy will pull you when he decides that you are weakened

00:08:00.680 --> 00:08:02.640
Then you have to attack

00:08:04.300 --> 00:08:06.140
Thanks for the advice, master

00:08:11.560 --> 00:08:12.520
Where are you going?

00:08:14.060 --> 00:08:16.070
Swim and change clothes

00:08:16.150 --> 00:08:17.780
I already smell

00:08:19.190 --> 00:08:21.360
Oh, you're looking for him

00:08:28.910 --> 00:08:30.210
Don't go

00:08:33.880 --> 00:08:35.880
Don't go to your place, stay here

00:08:36.750 --> 00:08:39.300
- I'll bring some clothes
- Why?

00:08:39.380 --> 00:08:41.220
I can go change my clothes

00:08:42.180 --> 00:08:43.930
Why overwork yourself like a fool?

00:08:49.310 --> 00:08:50.390
You're right

00:08:52.480 --> 00:08:54.100
I'm acting like a fool

00:08:58.480 --> 00:08:59.400
Go

00:09:04.070 --> 00:09:05.120
Moo Deok

00:09:05.200 --> 00:09:06.620
Wait a minute

00:09:08.450 --> 00:09:09.490
What?

00:09:16.590 --> 00:09:17.750
Sit down

00:09:18.590 --> 00:09:19.760
Yes, sit down

00:09:25.680 --> 00:09:27.850
Look at the shoes. All wet

00:09:31.140 --> 00:09:31.980
Why...

00:09:33.230 --> 00:09:35.940
Why did you even follow me into the water?

00:09:38.820 --> 00:09:43.030
Sometimes you work too hard

00:09:43.110 --> 00:09:45.740
Why bother so much with cleaning?

00:09:45.820 --> 00:09:48.200
Rest by referring to me

00:09:50.450 --> 00:09:53.410
Maid Kim sent dried ears to Corwin

00:09:53.500 --> 00:09:56.370
Eat for yourself too, don’t leave everything to me

00:09:57.670 --> 00:09:58.880
Don't worry

00:10:00.960 --> 00:10:03.670
They treat me well because I'm close to Dan Gu

00:10:03.760 --> 00:10:05.180
heir to Sosnovy Bor

00:10:07.260 --> 00:10:08.390
Here's how

00:10:09.510 --> 00:10:13.600
I knew you used power to your advantage

00:10:20.650 --> 00:10:22.070
You're hurt

00:10:24.490 --> 00:10:26.360
I fought for eight days straight

00:10:27.450 --> 00:10:28.870
This is not the only wound

00:10:31.370 --> 00:10:32.740
Where else?

00:10:33.580 --> 00:10:35.500
Gotta go to Saejukwon

00:10:35.580 --> 00:10:37.170
There are still fights left

00:10:39.630 --> 00:10:41.460
You have to suffer so much

00:10:42.800 --> 00:10:44.550
as far as my master is waiting

00:11:00.860 --> 00:11:02.230
Feet will freeze

00:11:03.360 --> 00:11:04.780
You also change your clothes

00:11:46.530 --> 00:11:47.650
Maid Kim?

00:12:01.540 --> 00:12:03.250
Ready, Your Highness

00:12:03.340 --> 00:12:06.340
The medicine is bitter. Any sweets?

00:12:06.420 --> 00:12:08.590
I'll bring something

00:12:19.350 --> 00:12:21.560
There must also be red jade

00:12:22.440 --> 00:12:24.480
They only have value as a pair

00:12:26.190 --> 00:12:27.820
Maybe just throw it away?

00:13:07.230 --> 00:13:08.570
What?..

00:13:09.150 --> 00:13:10.360
What's going on?

00:13:18.870 --> 00:13:21.000
What is this?

00:13:33.220 --> 00:13:37.640
Something beckons me with incredible force

00:13:41.470 --> 00:13:43.100
Inexplicable attraction...

00:13:44.230 --> 00:13:45.190
It's calling me

00:14:37.530 --> 00:14:39.030
- Damn it
- That's right

00:14:39.120 --> 00:14:41.450
Why was it necessary to pour energy into jade?

00:14:41.530 --> 00:14:43.540
and so confuse me?

00:14:43.620 --> 00:14:45.500
This is quite offensive

00:14:45.580 --> 00:14:46.410
Same thing

00:14:46.500 --> 00:14:51.040
I'm offended that my heart beat like that because of you!

00:14:55.880 --> 00:14:56.930
And you...

00:14:57.970 --> 00:14:59.140
Did you feel it too?

00:15:00.510 --> 00:15:03.930
My heart was beating so...

00:15:06.560 --> 00:15:08.310
- Well...
- Don't say

00:15:11.020 --> 00:15:12.150
Forget it

00:15:12.940 --> 00:15:14.150
You're so surprised

00:15:14.980 --> 00:15:17.030
means I've never used it

00:15:17.860 --> 00:15:18.780
Yes

00:15:18.860 --> 00:15:20.410
Moo Deok doesn't have magic

00:15:21.070 --> 00:15:22.700
You wouldn't be able to exchange energy

00:15:22.780 --> 00:15:23.870
Yes

00:15:24.410 --> 00:15:27.080
I didn't know this jade had such power

00:15:42.680 --> 00:15:44.390
Enough is enough

00:15:45.770 --> 00:15:47.770
Anyway,

00:15:48.560 --> 00:15:50.060
I learned something new

00:15:50.900 --> 00:15:52.810
- Thank you
- What?

00:15:52.900 --> 00:15:53.980
Thinking about using it?

00:15:55.020 --> 00:15:56.360
It's unlikely you can

00:15:57.780 --> 00:15:59.150
Moo Deok won't get it back

00:15:59.240 --> 00:16:01.200
I have two more fights

00:16:01.740 --> 00:16:03.780
I'll return it and use it

00:16:03.870 --> 00:16:05.830
Save until then

00:16:07.330 --> 00:16:08.830
And please

00:16:09.500 --> 00:16:10.920
don't play with energy

00:16:12.880 --> 00:16:14.420
You too

00:16:19.800 --> 00:16:22.180
Your Highness, where have you been?

00:16:23.600 --> 00:16:24.760
Should I take you in?

00:16:26.260 --> 00:16:27.310
I can

00:16:27.930 --> 00:16:30.230
You will find a job here

00:16:31.640 --> 00:16:32.770
I don't want to

00:16:33.860 --> 00:16:35.690
- Eunuch O
- Yes?

00:16:35.770 --> 00:16:38.690
Find out who's next to fight Uka

00:16:39.280 --> 00:16:40.240
Yes

00:16:40.860 --> 00:16:42.030
Make no mistake

00:16:42.700 --> 00:16:43.870
Hyonggon Art

00:16:43.950 --> 00:16:44.820
Hey

00:16:44.910 --> 00:16:46.830
How do you like the fight?

00:16:46.910 --> 00:16:50.040
With Chan Wook? As easy as shelling pears

00:16:50.960 --> 00:16:53.170
-Are you ready for yours?
- Of course

00:16:53.250 --> 00:16:55.710
I use Hyunggon, after all...

00:16:59.380 --> 00:17:02.050
Cha family magician who wields Hyeongon

00:17:02.720 --> 00:17:04.760
He was watching Uk the whole time

00:17:04.840 --> 00:17:08.680
A coward who decided to fight only after Chan Wook lost

00:17:09.560 --> 00:17:11.480
Uk can defeat him

00:17:15.100 --> 00:17:18.150
Hyonggon - fascinating art

00:17:18.820 --> 00:17:21.190
But useless if skills are lacking

00:17:22.110 --> 00:17:24.160
Cha Bum looks quite scary

00:17:24.240 --> 00:17:25.660
but that's just a façade

00:17:26.700 --> 00:17:29.160
Seo Yul reads others easily, no wonder

00:17:29.660 --> 00:17:30.750
Yes?

00:17:31.290 --> 00:17:33.670
And he goes around telling everyone how easy it will be

00:17:34.210 --> 00:17:35.960
defeat the owner

00:17:36.040 --> 00:17:37.130
He's just afraid

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:40.420
Uk has improved significantly these days

00:17:41.050 --> 00:17:43.630
Bum is afraid that Wook will defeat him

00:17:44.840 --> 00:17:49.100
So my master has improved so much that he makes others worry

00:17:51.850 --> 00:17:54.100
Are you so glad that Wook has become stronger?

00:17:54.190 --> 00:17:57.110
Certainly. Pride straight to the skies

00:17:58.520 --> 00:18:01.480
Nak Soo trains Wook

00:18:01.570 --> 00:18:02.650
Yul

00:18:05.530 --> 00:18:06.910
Did you hear?

00:18:06.990 --> 00:18:08.700
There's a commotion in the capital

00:18:09.580 --> 00:18:10.740
What happened?

00:18:10.830 --> 00:18:14.460
Master Kang of Degantongun dies of illness

00:18:15.830 --> 00:18:16.870
But there are rumors

00:18:17.540 --> 00:18:19.670
that he was attacked by mercenaries last night

00:18:20.960 --> 00:18:23.840
Uncle and Master Huo went to the funeral

00:18:24.420 --> 00:18:27.180
What if these are mercenaries like Nak Su?

00:18:39.190 --> 00:18:41.730
The deceased Kang Man Jung

00:18:43.690 --> 00:18:46.030
Why can't we express our condolences?

00:18:47.820 --> 00:18:50.780
Our family is engaged in the transportation of expensive goods

00:18:50.870 --> 00:18:53.450
If people find out that the head of the house

00:18:53.540 --> 00:18:57.250
was killed by mercenaries, the family will lose their jobs

00:18:57.960 --> 00:18:59.540
It was announced that he died of a contagious disease

00:19:00.130 --> 00:19:01.460
Therefore no one can enter

00:19:04.760 --> 00:19:06.420
I see

00:19:06.510 --> 00:19:09.300
Are there any clues that will help find the mercenaries?

00:19:11.260 --> 00:19:12.930
Have you performed an autopsy?

00:19:14.640 --> 00:19:18.060
Master Kang was stabbed to death with a sword before our eyes

00:19:18.650 --> 00:19:19.980
There was no need

00:19:21.610 --> 00:19:23.400
His body will be burned tonight

00:19:23.480 --> 00:19:25.030
So soon?

00:19:25.610 --> 00:19:26.740
It's unfortunate

00:19:26.820 --> 00:19:28.660
but we have to hurry before rumors spread

00:19:28.740 --> 00:19:32.660
I'm sure Master Kahn would like the same

00:19:32.740 --> 00:19:33.790
This is unacceptable

00:19:33.870 --> 00:19:36.000
If you cremate him,

00:19:36.660 --> 00:19:39.250
there will be no evidence of murder

00:19:41.670 --> 00:19:43.130
It's a family matter

00:19:44.460 --> 00:19:46.300
I understand you are worried

00:19:47.300 --> 00:19:50.300
But the head of Sosnovy Bor doesn’t need to get involved in this

00:19:51.590 --> 00:19:54.010
Autopsy required

00:19:54.100 --> 00:19:55.810
Postpone cremation

00:19:57.180 --> 00:20:01.020
Has Pine Forest gone so far as to interfere in other people's funerals?

00:20:04.400 --> 00:20:05.730
We don't interfere

00:20:06.480 --> 00:20:10.740
I'm trying to warn the new head of the house

00:20:10.820 --> 00:20:12.740
from an irreparable mistake

00:20:12.820 --> 00:20:14.870
Why are you against it?

00:20:14.950 --> 00:20:16.490
What right do you have?

00:20:16.580 --> 00:20:20.120
Not long ago, the magicians were attacked by Nak Su

00:20:20.210 --> 00:20:22.290
Now new mercenaries have appeared

00:20:23.040 --> 00:20:25.750
There may be a connection between this case and Nak Soo's magic

00:20:26.420 --> 00:20:27.630
So I intervene

00:20:28.840 --> 00:20:30.680
There was no magic

00:20:30.760 --> 00:20:31.680
I can confirm

00:20:31.760 --> 00:20:33.640
Where does such confidence come from without an autopsy?!

00:20:35.050 --> 00:20:38.470
The head does not want to perform an autopsy

00:20:38.560 --> 00:20:40.770
Jin Mu, just shut up

00:20:41.350 --> 00:20:43.400
We have the right to intervene,

00:20:43.480 --> 00:20:45.060
when it comes to magic

00:20:45.150 --> 00:20:47.610
Do you agree, Ms. Jin?

00:20:49.570 --> 00:20:50.950
I think

00:20:52.530 --> 00:20:55.120
this time the deputy is right

00:20:58.950 --> 00:21:01.500
The new head confirmed the death of Master Kang

00:21:01.580 --> 00:21:05.130
And he has no choice
except to hide the real reason

00:21:07.000 --> 00:21:09.960
No evidence pointing to magic

00:21:11.300 --> 00:21:15.140
Therefore, I doubt that Sosnovy Bor has anything to catch here

00:21:21.980 --> 00:21:24.190
I just want to preserve the dignity of a master

00:21:24.270 --> 00:21:27.730
Let us continue with the funeral

00:21:50.710 --> 00:21:53.930
Jin Moo openly neglects us

00:21:56.930 --> 00:21:59.220
Why were they so against it?

00:22:00.390 --> 00:22:02.560
- Strange
- And also,

00:22:02.640 --> 00:22:06.770
I didn't think Ms. Jin would take his side

00:22:07.360 --> 00:22:09.690
She hated her stepbrother

00:22:13.900 --> 00:22:17.110
I was glad when you took my side

00:22:18.990 --> 00:22:20.030
Judge for yourself

00:22:20.120 --> 00:22:24.330
As soon as we united, Sosnovy Bor had to give in

00:22:26.080 --> 00:22:28.040
How is the search for Boo Young going?

00:22:30.550 --> 00:22:32.960
We searched all the surroundings of the lake

00:22:33.050 --> 00:22:36.090
looking for a blind girl of the same age

00:22:37.680 --> 00:22:41.260
I've been doing this for the last ten years.

00:22:41.350 --> 00:22:42.390
To be honest,

00:22:43.180 --> 00:22:45.810
I think I know what happened to Boo Young

00:22:47.270 --> 00:22:50.520
Ten years ago, a little girl washed up on the river bank

00:22:52.190 --> 00:22:54.150
- Yes?
- Only here

00:22:56.070 --> 00:22:57.780
she was long dead

00:23:04.700 --> 00:23:08.540
Mother, I'm sure it's not her

00:23:08.620 --> 00:23:11.250
I told my people to dig up the grave

00:23:12.090 --> 00:23:14.460
If Boo Young is really dead,

00:23:14.550 --> 00:23:18.130
I will bring you her body at any cost

00:23:18.970 --> 00:23:20.510
This won't work

00:23:21.390 --> 00:23:24.060
Give me back my daughter alive

00:23:25.220 --> 00:23:27.390
Definitely, just calm down

00:23:28.560 --> 00:23:30.520
We will find her alive

00:23:46.410 --> 00:23:48.040
Did you look at it well?

00:23:48.910 --> 00:23:51.210
Your future mother and sister

00:23:51.920 --> 00:23:53.040
Do you think

00:23:53.920 --> 00:23:56.170
will they believe that I am their daughter?

00:23:56.260 --> 00:23:57.590
Are you dressed

00:23:58.920 --> 00:24:01.800
like Boo Young as a child

00:24:01.890 --> 00:24:03.890
But I don't think Ho Kyung will buy it

00:24:06.350 --> 00:24:08.600
Then nice clothes

00:24:10.390 --> 00:24:12.230
won't play into our hands

00:24:12.810 --> 00:24:15.360
I must look pathetic

00:24:16.650 --> 00:24:18.690
She lost her daughter

00:24:18.780 --> 00:24:22.820
If she takes pity on me, I'll only win her heart

00:24:25.660 --> 00:24:26.790
Yes

00:24:27.750 --> 00:24:29.460
You're right, So Yi

00:24:33.710 --> 00:24:34.960
I will definitely

00:24:37.670 --> 00:24:40.550
I will become the daughter of the Jin family

00:24:53.690 --> 00:24:55.310
You look better

00:24:55.980 --> 00:24:58.230
Yes, I recover quickly

00:25:09.620 --> 00:25:11.790
Hyonggon Art

00:25:12.750 --> 00:25:14.130
elaborated

00:25:20.130 --> 00:25:23.930
I have suspicions regarding Master Kang's death

00:25:36.310 --> 00:25:40.070
He was strong, he was good at spells

00:25:40.150 --> 00:25:42.820
But he was already dying of illness

00:25:43.610 --> 00:25:46.990
There was no need to send as a mercenary

00:25:47.070 --> 00:25:49.200
Maybe someone held a grudge against him

00:25:49.990 --> 00:25:52.080
and wanted to kill myself

00:25:52.160 --> 00:25:53.080
No

00:25:53.160 --> 00:25:55.000
We don't know yet

00:25:56.210 --> 00:25:58.790
but there must be a reason for the attack

00:26:01.800 --> 00:26:05.090
When the soul passes into a new body, there is no need for the old one

00:26:05.680 --> 00:26:07.720
But getting rid of it is not so easy

00:26:07.800 --> 00:26:11.270
In the eyes of people, he was a powerful magician,

00:26:11.350 --> 00:26:13.230
official or merchant

00:26:13.890 --> 00:26:16.520
If he suddenly disappears, suspicions will arise

00:26:18.310 --> 00:26:23.030
Nak Soo took care of such things

00:26:23.110 --> 00:26:25.150
Are you talking about the warrior of darkness?

00:26:27.490 --> 00:26:30.080
Thanks to this warrior,

00:26:30.660 --> 00:26:34.960
Sosnovy Bor didn’t even allow the thought that I was creating nomads

00:26:36.290 --> 00:26:38.580
When I was hunting for Nak Soo

00:26:38.670 --> 00:26:42.170
I thought she was crazy and wanted to prove herself

00:26:42.250 --> 00:26:46.220
So I never looked at who she killed

00:26:48.840 --> 00:26:50.760
That is, she killed those

00:26:51.510 --> 00:26:53.810
whose souls did Jin Mu move?

00:26:53.890 --> 00:26:55.310
More precisely those

00:26:56.390 --> 00:26:59.480
who was no longer needed after the move

00:26:59.560 --> 00:27:02.190
You said she was Cho Chun's daughter

00:27:02.980 --> 00:27:07.780
So he took a little girl and made her a mercenary?

00:27:09.570 --> 00:27:11.990
That's why I didn't reveal my identity to her

00:27:12.740 --> 00:27:14.950
and forced me to live alone in the mountains

00:27:16.460 --> 00:27:18.710
Gave her no more than she needed to survive

00:27:19.540 --> 00:27:23.460
But she was determined and grew strong

00:27:25.010 --> 00:27:26.550
Because...

00:27:27.130 --> 00:27:29.970
She thought she was taking revenge for her family.

00:27:30.050 --> 00:27:31.550
Therefore, she obeyed Jin Mu

00:27:33.470 --> 00:27:35.930
She was helpful

00:27:36.520 --> 00:27:39.440
And then one nomad turned into a soul swallower

00:27:40.100 --> 00:27:41.400
For this reason

00:27:42.440 --> 00:27:44.690
Sosnovy Bor suspected the alchemy of souls

00:27:45.730 --> 00:27:47.900
When Jin Mu found out that we were looking for her,

00:27:48.740 --> 00:27:51.450
he was afraid that he would be caught

00:27:52.240 --> 00:27:57.160
Surely he sent her to Sosnovy Bor, knowing that she would die

00:28:10.470 --> 00:28:12.760
Moo Deok, bring some water

00:28:12.850 --> 00:28:13.890
Okay

00:28:22.440 --> 00:28:25.690
Moo Deok, didn't you listen to me?

00:28:25.770 --> 00:28:27.820
I told you to rest

00:28:30.820 --> 00:28:32.410
What about yourself?

00:28:32.490 --> 00:28:34.450
I told you to heal the wounds

00:28:34.530 --> 00:28:37.750
I went to Sejukwon. I listened to you

00:28:41.460 --> 00:28:42.670
You can check

00:28:45.960 --> 00:28:47.170
Smells like wormwood

00:28:54.350 --> 00:28:55.680
What are you doing?

00:28:55.760 --> 00:28:59.100
I have fights every day. Just tired

00:29:06.320 --> 00:29:07.650
Warmth

00:29:10.320 --> 00:29:12.450
Did they rub you with warm wormwood?

00:29:13.240 --> 00:29:15.370
I'm warm, right?

00:29:16.830 --> 00:29:19.370
Yes. Warm

00:29:23.670 --> 00:29:27.460
She was deceived and sent to certain death

00:29:28.500 --> 00:29:29.510
Nak Su...

00:29:29.590 --> 00:29:32.420
I really feel sorry for this child

00:29:41.850 --> 00:29:43.480
You've cooled down. Let go

00:29:46.360 --> 00:29:49.400
-Have you changed your shoes?
- Yes

00:29:49.480 --> 00:29:51.150
Did you eat what maid Kim brought?

00:29:51.240 --> 00:29:54.530
Yes. Actually, I ate before you suggested.

00:29:55.110 --> 00:29:57.070
Well done, Moo Deok

00:29:59.120 --> 00:30:01.750
I didn't even know that this stone could

00:30:04.500 --> 00:30:05.580
Yin-yang jade?

00:30:05.670 --> 00:30:07.670
I only understood because you gave it to the prince

00:30:08.420 --> 00:30:10.000
And what can he do?

00:30:10.090 --> 00:30:12.050
- Show me
- I can’t

00:30:12.130 --> 00:30:13.720
I'll show you

00:30:13.800 --> 00:30:15.930
when will I return yours

00:30:17.430 --> 00:30:18.720
Will you give it to me

00:30:19.720 --> 00:30:21.140
when will you pick it up?

00:30:22.890 --> 00:30:25.310
And what? Won't you accept?

00:30:28.980 --> 00:30:32.650
I'll return it and put it in your hands

00:30:32.740 --> 00:30:35.530
It has a lot of power

00:30:35.610 --> 00:30:36.950
Luckily we didn't know about it

00:30:37.030 --> 00:30:39.580
You will be surprised when you see

00:30:43.660 --> 00:30:45.830
What kind of power? Show me

00:30:46.500 --> 00:30:49.380
The Crown Prince fell to the ground, foaming at the mouth.

00:30:49.960 --> 00:30:51.380
It was terrible

00:30:51.460 --> 00:30:53.960
This makes sense. He's from Jinyeowon

00:30:54.050 --> 00:30:56.050
This could be a serious weapon

00:31:18.740 --> 00:31:20.320
Hello, Deputy

00:31:25.750 --> 00:31:27.330
Head of Sosnovy Bor

00:31:27.410 --> 00:31:30.540
returned to witness the cremation in person

00:31:31.210 --> 00:31:33.340
What are you up to this time?

00:31:33.420 --> 00:31:36.170
I came just to see

00:31:37.130 --> 00:31:40.090
Still, this is the last time I see Master Kahn.

00:31:40.180 --> 00:31:42.600
I have to carry it out

00:32:15.420 --> 00:32:18.470
Have you already seen the nomad?

00:32:18.550 --> 00:32:20.470
so you will recognize the blue mark

00:32:21.390 --> 00:32:24.760
See if Master Kang has such a mark on his body

00:32:24.850 --> 00:32:27.100
Even if we discover the alchemy of souls,

00:32:27.180 --> 00:32:29.350
we won't know whose body he moved into

00:32:30.730 --> 00:32:34.690
There's something you need to do to help figure this out.

00:33:06.310 --> 00:33:09.730
I know that you have already mastered Chisu

00:33:10.850 --> 00:33:12.850
I didn't deliberately keep quiet about it

00:33:12.940 --> 00:33:14.350
I'm not scolding you

00:33:15.270 --> 00:33:16.980
What I'm asking you to do is

00:33:17.070 --> 00:33:19.610
very dangerous and can drain your energy

00:33:20.400 --> 00:33:22.740
But only those who own Chisu can do this

00:33:23.820 --> 00:33:26.950
Nomad turns into a souleater when he loses energy

00:33:27.700 --> 00:33:30.120
His body is still warm

00:33:30.870 --> 00:33:33.170
Pour your energy into it,

00:33:33.750 --> 00:33:36.340
so that he goes wild

00:34:03.530 --> 00:34:05.200
Mister...

00:34:08.780 --> 00:34:10.120
What is it?

00:34:10.200 --> 00:34:12.830
He...

00:34:27.140 --> 00:34:29.720
I'll collect the bones, everyone stand back

00:34:32.810 --> 00:34:35.730
This is a nomad

00:34:35.810 --> 00:34:38.980
who turned to stone

00:34:41.650 --> 00:34:45.030
No one doubts that magic is involved here

00:34:46.410 --> 00:34:48.660
Now Sosnovy Bor can intervene?

00:34:56.120 --> 00:35:00.540
You're not upset, you even tried to hide it

00:35:01.130 --> 00:35:03.590
So you knew about it

00:35:05.920 --> 00:35:06.970
You knew

00:35:07.630 --> 00:35:12.510
that this is a nomad who has gone wild

00:35:36.250 --> 00:35:38.040
Your skills speak volumes

00:35:38.120 --> 00:35:41.250
that Master Kang's soul is in this body

00:35:42.920 --> 00:35:44.800
So his soul

00:35:44.880 --> 00:35:46.970
died in your body

00:35:47.050 --> 00:35:48.760
Nonsense!

00:36:08.240 --> 00:36:09.450
You're going wild

00:36:10.030 --> 00:36:11.990
deprived of blood and energy

00:36:15.240 --> 00:36:18.500
The more energy you use, the faster you turn to stone

00:36:19.120 --> 00:36:20.420
Stop it

00:36:26.880 --> 00:36:29.090
You better not move!

00:36:35.350 --> 00:36:37.350
- Don't kill him
- Kill

00:38:22.870 --> 00:38:25.210
A feral nomad is dangerous

00:38:25.710 --> 00:38:27.500
Fortunately, Jeonbugwan dealt with him

00:38:28.080 --> 00:38:29.590
You helped us

00:38:29.670 --> 00:38:32.920
so you can take some of the glory

00:38:37.010 --> 00:38:39.010
Mister

00:38:49.060 --> 00:38:51.570
Since we are due a share of the glory,

00:38:51.650 --> 00:38:53.690
we will take the body and study it

00:38:56.150 --> 00:38:57.570
Please

00:39:10.920 --> 00:39:12.590
I closed its gates

00:39:12.670 --> 00:39:15.380
so that energy does not leak out

00:39:16.130 --> 00:39:18.220
I wish I could bring him back to life to interrogate him.

00:39:19.220 --> 00:39:20.550
Is this possible?

00:39:21.600 --> 00:39:25.480
Consider it a breathing stone. Do you want him to talk?

00:39:25.560 --> 00:39:27.020
It won't be easy

00:39:35.360 --> 00:39:38.450
Are you afraid that he might be alive?

00:39:40.870 --> 00:39:42.660
Even so, they won't succeed

00:39:43.580 --> 00:39:46.160
This would be possible with an ice stone

00:39:46.660 --> 00:39:48.250
But they don't have it

00:39:48.920 --> 00:39:52.040
So it can be revived with a stone?

00:39:52.130 --> 00:39:53.130
Yes

00:39:54.130 --> 00:39:56.670
And do you have this stone?

00:39:57.800 --> 00:39:59.260
You don't need to know

00:40:00.640 --> 00:40:02.470
Prepare the mercenaries

00:40:03.220 --> 00:40:04.760
I'll find a way

00:40:04.850 --> 00:40:07.390
even if you have to transfer the soul into the body of the magician Jeongjingak

00:40:14.480 --> 00:40:16.690
- Hey, Bom
- What?

00:40:16.780 --> 00:40:17.740
Let's go

00:40:26.120 --> 00:40:27.370
Hyonggon Art

00:40:27.450 --> 00:40:29.040
Leopard Head Press Stance

00:40:29.120 --> 00:40:30.960
Direct attack stance

00:42:04.300 --> 00:42:05.470
Yul

00:42:07.220 --> 00:42:08.640
Uk

00:42:09.600 --> 00:42:10.970
Are you going to training?

00:42:12.140 --> 00:42:13.100
Yes

00:42:13.890 --> 00:42:14.810
What about you?

00:42:20.860 --> 00:42:22.190
And I fought

00:42:24.150 --> 00:42:25.490
with a nomad

00:42:29.410 --> 00:42:32.540
The late Master Kan was a nomad

00:42:34.040 --> 00:42:35.370
Really?

00:42:35.460 --> 00:42:37.290
How did you know?

00:42:38.630 --> 00:42:40.300
If you hide the blue mark,

00:42:40.380 --> 00:42:42.550
they are indistinguishable from other people

00:42:43.470 --> 00:42:45.220
But once they go wild,

00:42:46.430 --> 00:42:47.930
there's no turning back

00:42:54.730 --> 00:42:57.560
Losing energy, they turn into stone

00:42:58.440 --> 00:43:01.480
And you can only recover by sucking out someone else’s energy

00:43:02.980 --> 00:43:04.490
Having done this once,

00:43:06.610 --> 00:43:08.570
they turn into monsters

00:43:11.790 --> 00:43:12.950
Monsters?

00:43:28.010 --> 00:43:30.390
And our task is to protect the world

00:43:34.520 --> 00:43:36.100
from them

00:43:44.780 --> 00:43:47.360
We can protect these monsters from the world

00:43:49.280 --> 00:43:50.910
We'll keep an eye on him

00:43:51.740 --> 00:43:53.620
and there will be peace in the world

00:43:54.830 --> 00:43:57.500
Everyone has high hopes for you since childhood,

00:43:57.580 --> 00:44:00.540
so you think you should do something worthwhile

00:44:00.630 --> 00:44:01.960
Well, they told me

00:44:03.210 --> 00:44:05.260
so that I don't stick my head out

00:44:07.720 --> 00:44:08.930
I

00:44:10.470 --> 00:44:12.260
I will follow my heart

00:44:38.830 --> 00:44:42.130
Jin Mu let Pine Forest come close

00:44:42.210 --> 00:44:44.920
What if they start to suspect the palace?

00:44:45.670 --> 00:44:46.960
Palace...

00:44:47.960 --> 00:44:52.430
not a place where Park Jin can just barge in like Daegantonggun

00:44:52.510 --> 00:44:55.560
But if he shows up I'll be in danger

00:44:56.140 --> 00:44:57.970
Since Kil Ju's death

00:44:58.060 --> 00:44:59.850
I didn't feed on energy

00:45:01.640 --> 00:45:04.270
I'm afraid I'm going wild

00:45:07.650 --> 00:45:10.110
Can you share with me

00:45:11.030 --> 00:45:12.610
the power of the ice stone?

00:45:13.950 --> 00:45:14.950
What?

00:45:15.030 --> 00:45:18.450
The only one who can serve you knowing your true face,

00:45:22.670 --> 00:45:24.330
It's me, don't you agree?

00:45:25.540 --> 00:45:26.750
Shaman

00:45:28.000 --> 00:45:29.630
Scum...

00:45:29.710 --> 00:45:32.220
I told you not to talk to me like that

00:45:34.260 --> 00:45:36.510
Do you want to quickly turn into stone?

00:45:39.100 --> 00:45:40.310
I know you can't

00:45:41.980 --> 00:45:44.520
I'm the only one in the palace who knows

00:45:44.600 --> 00:45:47.520
that you are a shaman Choi,

00:45:47.610 --> 00:45:50.650
migrated into the queen's body

00:45:52.070 --> 00:45:53.530
If I die

00:45:53.610 --> 00:45:57.830
Can you transfer your sister from Jinyeowon here?

00:46:02.160 --> 00:46:03.370
Besides,

00:46:04.120 --> 00:46:09.090
a real queen in your body

00:46:11.130 --> 00:46:15.390
Should I stop visiting her?

00:46:15.970 --> 00:46:17.010
A?

00:46:21.560 --> 00:46:23.690
It's getting harder for me

00:46:24.730 --> 00:46:26.650
live in this body

00:46:28.650 --> 00:46:30.860
Tell Jin Moo

00:46:30.940 --> 00:46:34.780
move my soul to another body

00:46:36.490 --> 00:46:37.740
Your Majesty

00:46:41.160 --> 00:46:42.410
Okay

00:46:43.500 --> 00:46:44.870
You can go

00:47:10.940 --> 00:47:12.230
Why are you here?

00:47:13.190 --> 00:47:15.400
I'll give in to you and it'll all be over

00:47:20.320 --> 00:47:22.160
I give up

00:47:22.740 --> 00:47:24.040
Hey, Uk... Uk!

00:47:31.290 --> 00:47:32.840
You wanted to leave before me

00:47:32.920 --> 00:47:34.170
And you won

00:47:41.180 --> 00:47:43.600
Dan Gu wanted to let you win

00:47:43.680 --> 00:47:45.060
How could you refuse?

00:47:45.140 --> 00:47:47.520
I didn't know you were so proud of yourself

00:47:47.600 --> 00:47:50.520
Hey, you did this to make me refuse

00:47:50.610 --> 00:47:51.690
When is this?

00:47:51.770 --> 00:47:53.610
It was a look of relief

00:47:53.690 --> 00:47:55.440
I had to show

00:47:56.110 --> 00:47:57.030
Like this

00:47:57.110 --> 00:47:58.400
That's what I did

00:47:59.490 --> 00:48:02.780
And how was this to be understood? If I understood, I would agree

00:48:04.330 --> 00:48:05.910
One fight left

00:48:06.620 --> 00:48:07.870
What will you do?

00:48:07.960 --> 00:48:09.460
Wait, are you blaming me?

00:48:10.040 --> 00:48:12.670
You gave him the jade yourself, and you’re angry with me?

00:48:12.750 --> 00:48:15.300
Are you moving the arrows now?

00:48:15.380 --> 00:48:16.840
How childish

00:48:16.920 --> 00:48:19.430
Childish? Show really childish behavior?

00:48:19.510 --> 00:48:20.470
I'm leaving everything

00:48:21.590 --> 00:48:22.600
Should I behave like this?

00:48:32.690 --> 00:48:35.480
Mages have been guarding Saejukwon since last night

00:48:36.570 --> 00:48:39.490
Surely the soulswallower's body is there

00:48:39.570 --> 00:48:42.320
If he died, the body would be taken to the secret room

00:48:42.820 --> 00:48:45.540
Why was he put in Sejukwon, which is for the living?

00:48:54.590 --> 00:48:58.050
I came to find out what happened to the body

00:48:58.130 --> 00:49:00.380
Wait. I'll inform the head

00:49:17.070 --> 00:49:20.490
I heard that the head is in Saejukwon, so I came to see him.

00:49:20.570 --> 00:49:23.070
No one is allowed into Sejukwon yet

00:49:23.160 --> 00:49:25.450
Then first I will meet Mr.

00:49:25.530 --> 00:49:27.620
Tell the boss I'm here

00:49:29.200 --> 00:49:30.450
Jin Moo has arrived

00:49:31.830 --> 00:49:34.830
check if the soulslayer really died

00:49:35.960 --> 00:49:38.340
Tell him to leave while we're still investigating.

00:49:38.420 --> 00:49:41.510
Yes. Someone else has come to see you

00:49:42.340 --> 00:49:43.470
Let him go

00:49:43.550 --> 00:49:46.140
Don't let anyone into Saejukwon

00:49:46.220 --> 00:49:47.180
Yes

00:49:47.260 --> 00:49:49.720
I'll tell maid Kim to leave

00:49:51.020 --> 00:49:52.140
What?

00:49:53.230 --> 00:49:54.400
Maid Kim?

00:49:54.480 --> 00:49:57.360
I'll tell her that the head can't accept anyone

00:50:00.280 --> 00:50:01.490
Wait a minute

00:50:02.780 --> 00:50:06.200
She can, as an exception

00:50:15.880 --> 00:50:18.250
Long time no see, maid Kim

00:50:37.560 --> 00:50:40.980
I stayed in Gwangju Chang Gan's house while serving him,

00:50:41.650 --> 00:50:44.610
and you cooked delicious food

00:50:45.740 --> 00:50:47.200
You ate so much

00:50:47.700 --> 00:50:51.120
that your rice bowl was the biggest

00:50:52.250 --> 00:50:53.370
Do you remember?

00:50:53.450 --> 00:50:56.620
You had just a huge bowl

00:50:56.710 --> 00:50:59.670
I was always hungry then

00:51:00.590 --> 00:51:04.170
You've probably cooked something delicious again

00:51:04.760 --> 00:51:07.890
Yes. I prepared them myself

00:51:12.060 --> 00:51:15.640
Honey cookies. I loved them so much before

00:51:15.730 --> 00:51:16.940
That's it

00:51:17.020 --> 00:51:20.020
I asked you to convey to Gwangju,

00:51:20.110 --> 00:51:23.150
and you put a couple in your pockets

00:51:24.360 --> 00:51:28.030
Because I could eat
only when he's finished

00:51:28.860 --> 00:51:32.990
Anyway, I gained a lot by following Gwangju

00:51:33.080 --> 00:51:35.120
I ate deliciously

00:51:36.080 --> 00:51:38.540
taught special spells

00:51:43.710 --> 00:51:47.130
They taste better when you eat them in secret, right?

00:51:53.930 --> 00:51:55.140
Therefore

00:51:56.100 --> 00:51:58.560
sweets are always so dangerous

00:51:58.640 --> 00:52:02.650
Once you try it, you won't be able to stop.

00:52:06.030 --> 00:52:07.610
You can't differentiate

00:52:09.160 --> 00:52:10.740
what can you eat,

00:52:12.450 --> 00:52:14.160
and what not

00:52:16.250 --> 00:52:19.000
You hurt me by not allowing me to even try.

00:52:21.000 --> 00:52:24.550
No need to be so greedy

00:52:28.760 --> 00:52:32.050
Gwangju really loved these cookies

00:52:32.140 --> 00:52:34.010
And his son?

00:52:34.100 --> 00:52:37.140
The young master loves them too

00:52:37.220 --> 00:52:39.690
Then you need to share it with him

00:52:40.850 --> 00:52:45.150
I can tell him many stories about my father

00:52:52.740 --> 00:52:56.040
You and Uk have nothing to talk about

00:52:56.120 --> 00:52:57.830
You can go

00:52:57.910 --> 00:53:00.750
He just wanted cookies. What's wrong with you?

00:53:01.460 --> 00:53:04.630
Don't let me share memories with him

00:53:04.710 --> 00:53:05.670
It must be

00:53:07.460 --> 00:53:09.920
again you don’t want me to touch yours

00:53:12.760 --> 00:53:13.890
Wait a minute

00:53:14.760 --> 00:53:17.970
This is for the lord

00:53:18.060 --> 00:53:19.600
but you can take it

00:53:20.140 --> 00:53:21.230
Maid Kim

00:53:22.140 --> 00:53:23.350
Don't give him

00:53:24.270 --> 00:53:26.320
If I really wanted to

00:53:26.860 --> 00:53:29.320
I would have already stolen a couple

00:53:29.990 --> 00:53:32.200
But I'll let you win

00:53:34.660 --> 00:53:38.910
We haven't seen each other for a long time. It's a pity to say goodbye

00:53:47.800 --> 00:53:49.050
Jin Mu took revenge before

00:53:49.130 --> 00:53:52.010
if he was scolded for eating

00:53:52.680 --> 00:53:54.260
It's just cookies

00:53:54.340 --> 00:53:55.970
I should have given him some

00:53:56.050 --> 00:53:58.140
I just don't want him to eat what

00:53:59.520 --> 00:54:03.310
that you had a hard time cooking

00:54:05.150 --> 00:54:06.270
Sit down

00:54:06.360 --> 00:54:08.480
We haven't seen each other for a long time

00:54:08.570 --> 00:54:11.990
Let's talk over a cup of tea

00:54:15.610 --> 00:54:17.320
Is something wrong?

00:54:18.160 --> 00:54:19.700
You look tired

00:54:23.710 --> 00:54:25.000
Don't worry

00:54:26.170 --> 00:54:30.460
I'll eat your cookies and I'll come to my senses right away.

00:54:40.430 --> 00:54:41.720
Moo Deok

00:54:42.890 --> 00:54:44.520
I have an errand

00:54:44.600 --> 00:54:46.560
An assignment? Which?

00:54:46.650 --> 00:54:47.860
Go to Jeonbugwan

00:54:49.060 --> 00:54:52.360
It's still wrong. Pass this on

00:54:53.690 --> 00:54:54.950
Of course

00:54:59.700 --> 00:55:01.620
Did something happen in Saejukwon?

00:55:02.700 --> 00:55:05.210
I don't know everything

00:55:05.290 --> 00:55:08.790
But it seems to be related to what happened with Degantongong

00:55:09.590 --> 00:55:11.750
I heard that Jeonbugwan and Sosnovy Bor were fighting

00:55:17.220 --> 00:55:18.090
Where is Yul?

00:55:18.180 --> 00:55:19.890
I haven't seen him since last night

00:55:19.970 --> 00:55:21.890
Carrying out the instructions of the head, probably

00:55:23.140 --> 00:55:24.270
Yes?

00:55:25.850 --> 00:55:27.140
And I fought

00:55:29.270 --> 00:55:30.690
with a nomad

00:55:43.290 --> 00:55:45.450
We must strengthen the borders

00:55:45.540 --> 00:55:48.370
You are prohibited from leaving Sosnovy Bor

00:55:50.290 --> 00:55:52.040
Those who own Ryusu and more,

00:55:52.130 --> 00:55:55.550
go to Saejukwon and follow Sang Ho's orders

00:55:55.630 --> 00:55:56.760
- Yes
- Yes

00:55:57.630 --> 00:55:58.550
Chan Wook

00:55:59.890 --> 00:56:00.890
You stay

00:56:02.300 --> 00:56:04.010
Everyone except Chan Wook

00:56:04.100 --> 00:56:06.890
follow Sang Ho to Saejukwon

00:56:06.980 --> 00:56:08.270
- Yes
- Yes

00:56:13.820 --> 00:56:14.980
Chapter

00:56:15.860 --> 00:56:17.780
Why am I not going?

00:56:17.860 --> 00:56:20.660
You don't need it because you're not needed there

00:56:21.910 --> 00:56:23.780
Is there something dangerous there?

00:56:24.830 --> 00:56:26.200
Is there a nomad there?

00:56:26.790 --> 00:56:28.870
It's not your concern

00:56:29.620 --> 00:56:31.040
Don't even be interested

00:56:31.130 --> 00:56:33.920
Why are you hiding everything from me? I'm a magician here too

00:56:34.000 --> 00:56:37.340
You are the exception to all the rules

00:56:37.920 --> 00:56:40.720
If you're bored, you can leave Sosnovy Bor

00:56:40.800 --> 00:56:44.180
Go home and do what you like

00:56:46.850 --> 00:56:50.350
Yes. Thank you for worrying

00:57:08.450 --> 00:57:09.620
Moo Deok

00:57:10.790 --> 00:57:13.000
Let's go to Chwisonra and eat something delicious

00:57:14.630 --> 00:57:18.090
All the magicians are in Sejukwon. Why don't you?

00:57:19.670 --> 00:57:21.130
I was told not to climb

00:57:21.220 --> 00:57:24.220
and that it's not my concern

00:57:24.800 --> 00:57:27.430
- Let's go
- Maid Kim gave me a task

00:57:28.140 --> 00:57:30.600
Okay. Let's go together. Where should I go?

00:57:31.440 --> 00:57:32.560
Jeonbugwan

00:57:34.310 --> 00:57:35.230
Let's go then

00:57:39.990 --> 00:57:44.660
Heard you told her you want a different body

00:57:46.780 --> 00:57:48.120
Will you give it to me?

00:57:48.910 --> 00:57:53.170
Then I want the body of a girl who will join Jinyoung as Boo Young

00:57:55.540 --> 00:57:57.250
Having been in the body of a eunuch,

00:57:58.000 --> 00:57:59.710
I wouldn't mind being in a woman's body

00:58:00.510 --> 00:58:05.430
I want a powerful body like a shaman's

00:58:07.100 --> 00:58:08.350
"Shaman"?

00:58:09.600 --> 00:58:11.930
She was upset that you reminded her of

00:58:12.020 --> 00:58:15.150
that she was a shaman, a fortune teller

00:58:15.770 --> 00:58:17.360
I didn't lie

00:58:19.820 --> 00:58:24.490
I was also reminded of how I begged for food and stole sweets

00:58:26.160 --> 00:58:30.200
It wasn't a lie, but I wasn't happy to hear something like that.

00:58:40.050 --> 00:58:43.220
Jin Mu wanted to eat cookies

00:58:43.300 --> 00:58:45.090
but Park Jin didn't let him

00:58:45.720 --> 00:58:47.720
Maid Kim was worried that Ji Moo would be offended,

00:58:47.800 --> 00:58:49.760
so I asked you to tell him this

00:58:49.850 --> 00:58:52.810
So they were arguing like children over food?

00:58:52.890 --> 00:58:55.640
The boss is so petty sometimes

00:58:55.730 --> 00:58:58.560
Arguing over honey cookies?!

00:58:58.650 --> 00:59:00.940
You're right, it's petty

00:59:08.070 --> 00:59:09.620
Here in Jeonbugwan

00:59:09.700 --> 00:59:12.490
we record all the stars

00:59:35.730 --> 00:59:39.190
I'll tell the deputy that it's from the Chan family.

00:59:39.980 --> 00:59:43.610
Tell him it's from Maid Kim

00:59:44.900 --> 00:59:47.240
And also that they contain a lot of oil

00:59:47.320 --> 00:59:49.620
and wash it down with green tea

00:59:49.700 --> 00:59:50.780
Yes sir

00:59:50.870 --> 00:59:53.490
And there, of course, is honey

00:59:53.580 --> 00:59:55.870
They must be stored in the cold, otherwise they will stick together.

00:59:55.950 --> 00:59:58.370
- Yes, sir
- And since we brought them,

00:59:58.460 --> 01:00:00.420
- can I go inside?
- Yes...

01:00:00.500 --> 01:00:02.920
- What?
- Thank you. We won't last long

01:00:03.000 --> 01:00:03.920
Let's go

01:00:05.590 --> 01:00:06.550
But...

01:00:14.390 --> 01:00:16.310
I've always wanted to visit here

01:00:16.390 --> 01:00:19.850
Even though my father is Gwangju, I was not allowed here

01:00:24.360 --> 01:00:26.650
Hey, what's this?

01:00:28.450 --> 01:00:31.030
You were here, right?

01:00:31.120 --> 01:00:33.240
Your father was an astrologer here

01:00:34.410 --> 01:00:36.330
Did you come here for me?

01:00:38.960 --> 01:00:42.040
You could have asked someone to deliver the cookies.

01:00:42.710 --> 01:00:45.750
But she came on her own because she wanted to, am I right?

01:00:50.430 --> 01:00:53.470
As a child, my father often brought me here

01:00:54.600 --> 01:00:58.020
Even showed me a recording of the day I was born

01:00:59.480 --> 01:01:01.100
He was a good father

01:01:04.610 --> 01:01:06.150
If you think about it

01:01:06.230 --> 01:01:09.320
there's probably a record here from your birthday too

01:01:11.700 --> 01:01:13.200
Do you think so?

01:01:14.530 --> 01:01:18.040
So the recording from that day must be here somewhere.

01:01:31.380 --> 01:01:33.930
You promised me a new body

01:01:34.470 --> 01:01:37.100
But instead you turn to stone

01:01:37.760 --> 01:01:39.180
You are no longer needed

01:01:39.850 --> 01:01:42.270
And you'll just turn to stone

01:01:57.990 --> 01:01:59.290
Bastard...

01:02:18.220 --> 01:02:20.470
When night comes, the magicians will come

01:02:21.100 --> 01:02:22.640
Let's see how they make records?

01:02:22.730 --> 01:02:24.810
They say it's an amazing sight

01:02:27.020 --> 01:02:30.730
It would be great, but there will be problems
if we get caught

01:02:30.820 --> 01:02:31.940
Let's go home

01:02:45.580 --> 01:02:47.250
Eunuch Kim went wild

01:02:47.330 --> 01:02:49.710
No one should know that he is a nomad

01:02:50.300 --> 01:02:53.720
He's still in Jeonbugwan. We must find him before dawn

01:02:53.800 --> 01:02:54.970
Yes

01:03:38.390 --> 01:03:39.850
I know you're here

01:03:40.390 --> 01:03:42.680
No need to create problems, come out

01:03:42.760 --> 01:03:44.310
I'll give you what you want

01:03:52.400 --> 01:03:53.650
Come out

01:03:55.940 --> 01:03:57.860
- Now!
- I'm leaving

01:04:02.910 --> 01:04:04.870
- Chan Wook
- Yes

01:04:10.420 --> 01:04:12.040
Why are you here?

01:04:12.540 --> 01:04:14.210
Sorry. I'm on an errand

01:04:14.300 --> 01:04:15.840
Well, I wanted to see

01:04:20.140 --> 01:04:21.300
An assignment?

01:04:21.930 --> 01:04:25.520
Heard you wanted honey cookies

01:04:26.680 --> 01:04:28.060
Cookies?

01:04:28.140 --> 01:04:30.190
Maid Kim noticed that you were upset,

01:04:30.270 --> 01:04:32.020
and asked me to give you some

01:04:34.650 --> 01:04:37.070
Thank you. Tell her I'm grateful

01:04:37.820 --> 01:04:38.950
What?

01:04:40.360 --> 01:04:43.280
I thought you'd be mad that I came in without permission

01:04:44.030 --> 01:04:44.910
Aren't you angry?

01:04:44.990 --> 01:04:48.290
You came to give me cookies. You can go

01:04:49.580 --> 01:04:51.580
Thankfully. To be honest...

01:04:53.130 --> 01:04:54.130
I'm not alone

01:04:55.550 --> 01:04:57.420
Moo Deok, come out. He's not angry

01:04:58.550 --> 01:05:00.470
This is my maid

01:05:02.010 --> 01:05:03.800
I'm Moo Deok

01:05:03.890 --> 01:05:05.430
his maid

01:05:07.970 --> 01:05:09.520
You're here too

01:05:10.230 --> 01:05:12.230
I thought you'd be angry

01:05:12.310 --> 01:05:15.440
Thank you for your hospitality

01:05:15.520 --> 01:05:16.820
Eat cookies

01:05:16.900 --> 01:05:19.240
If you want more, just tell me

01:05:21.990 --> 01:05:23.240
Thank you

01:05:23.320 --> 01:05:24.450
Let's go

01:05:39.630 --> 01:05:42.840
This is the royal eunuch

01:05:43.890 --> 01:05:45.300
What's wrong with him?

01:05:46.560 --> 01:05:47.970
He's a nomad

01:05:48.850 --> 01:05:51.440
Look. He went wild

01:05:59.400 --> 01:06:01.820
I can't believe the nomad was in the palace

01:06:01.900 --> 01:06:02.950
Perhaps

01:06:03.820 --> 01:06:05.120
it's his doing

01:06:08.450 --> 01:06:09.830
I know you're here

01:06:10.330 --> 01:06:12.710
No need to create problems, come out

01:06:12.790 --> 01:06:14.540
I'll give you what you want

01:06:21.340 --> 01:06:22.760
Come out!

01:06:31.350 --> 01:06:32.600
I'm going out

01:06:58.500 --> 01:06:59.710
Let's run

01:07:02.840 --> 01:07:04.090
Behind us is another door

01:07:17.100 --> 01:07:18.730
Why don't you let us go?

01:07:19.730 --> 01:07:23.820
It's hardly right to let go of a magician who got here so easily

01:07:23.900 --> 01:07:26.070
You'll have problems

01:07:27.070 --> 01:07:28.530
if I disappear in Jeonbugwan

01:07:28.620 --> 01:07:30.080
And I won't harm you

01:07:31.240 --> 01:07:33.450
Your body will be safe

01:07:42.960 --> 01:07:43.960
Chan Wook...

01:08:46.610 --> 01:08:48.900
You're inside the barrier I created

01:08:53.490 --> 01:08:54.620
Don't worry

01:08:55.490 --> 01:08:57.620
Stand still and you won't get hurt

01:08:59.250 --> 01:09:01.170
Wait here

01:09:14.720 --> 01:09:16.220
Was your name Moo Deok?

01:09:17.890 --> 01:09:19.850
The same maid

01:09:19.930 --> 01:09:24.150
who is always with him and from whom he is always in trouble

01:09:27.400 --> 01:09:29.400
There's a man here

01:09:29.940 --> 01:09:32.070
Go out and restore your energy

01:09:43.750 --> 01:09:45.210
And then

01:09:45.790 --> 01:09:49.710
I will move you into the body of the young master, just like you wanted

01:10:03.690 --> 01:10:05.230
This witch... shaman Choi

01:10:06.690 --> 01:10:08.820
did you say kill me?

01:10:09.860 --> 01:10:11.820
I need your help

01:10:12.570 --> 01:10:15.450
If you don't believe me, I'll come out

01:10:17.370 --> 01:10:19.580
You can snack on it

01:11:11.250 --> 01:11:12.840
We need to get out of here

01:12:07.770 --> 01:12:10.690
Teacher, help me again

01:12:11.440 --> 01:12:13.820
Give your student confidence

01:12:25.330 --> 01:12:26.500
Chan Wook

01:13:06.620 --> 01:13:07.660
Moo Deok...

01:13:10.210 --> 01:13:11.370
Moo Dok!

01:13:44.240 --> 01:13:45.370
Moo Deok...

01:14:13.770 --> 01:14:14.980
Moo Deok...

01:14:18.270 --> 01:14:19.440
I...

01:14:21.740 --> 01:14:23.700
just drained his energy

01:14:30.910 --> 01:14:32.120
I...

01:14:33.750 --> 01:14:35.290
running wild?

01:14:49.640 --> 01:14:51.560
- Moo Dok..
- Don't come near

01:15:04.950 --> 01:15:06.490
No. Everything is fine

01:15:07.240 --> 01:15:08.620
Are you okay

01:15:10.370 --> 01:15:12.200
- And you'll be fine
- No

01:15:13.200 --> 01:15:14.250
Don't touch me

01:15:16.330 --> 01:15:17.960
If I go wild

01:15:20.170 --> 01:15:22.010
you better not touch me

01:15:25.510 --> 01:15:27.220
Otherwise I will drain your energy too

01:15:28.090 --> 01:15:29.220
and you will die

01:16:39.320 --> 01:16:59.420
Thanks for watching with us!
http://doramamania

01:17:07.420 --> 01:17:10.380
Alchemy

01:17:07.420 --> 01:17:10.380
Shower

01:17:10.360 --> 01:17:12.530
There was some noise coming from the recording room.

01:17:12.620 --> 01:17:13.990
Come out!

01:17:14.080 --> 01:17:17.040
Are you angry that we turned your friend to stone?

01:17:17.120 --> 01:17:19.870
You will never leave this place

01:17:19.960 --> 01:17:23.000
So, this is a member of the Cho family?

01:17:23.080 --> 01:17:26.920
And if her spirit clung to Uka, what then?

01:17:27.000 --> 01:17:30.930
If I had not left you in the mountains,

01:17:31.010 --> 01:17:32.930
this wouldn't happen to you

01:17:33.010 --> 01:17:34.430
Are you putting your life on the line?

01:17:34.510 --> 01:17:36.510
Offer yourself this time

01:17:36.600 --> 01:17:38.220
I will definitely win tomorrow

01:17:38.310 --> 01:17:40.390
I need someone who is sure to win

01:17:40.480 --> 01:17:43.060
If he's looking for a stone to protect her...

01:17:43.150 --> 01:17:44.150
They can't be together

01:17:44.230 --> 01:17:46.690
Everything about you has come to light
